      "comment": "Disables a radio button UI element by setting greyed appearance and clearing interaction mask.\n\nClassification: Worker function - utility called to disable difficulty selection buttons\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set button's cel image to greyed radio button graphic (g_pCelRadioButtonGrey)\n2. Clear button's bit mask to prevent interaction (mask = 0)\n\nParameters:\n  pRadioButton (ECX): Pointer to radio button UI element to disable\n\nReturns: void\n\nCallers:\n  FUN_6fa0f810 - Disables Hell/Nightmare difficulty buttons when player level is insufficient\n\nNotes:\n  Used during game creation dialog to grey out difficulty levels the player cannot access.\n  Companion to enabling radio buttons which would set an active cel and non-zero mask.",
