      "name": "InitializeGameListPanel",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameListPanel(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the game list panel UI controls and session handling.\n\nClassification: Initialization function\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game list data pointer is valid (GetGameListDataPointer)\n2. If invalid (-1), display error message via ValidateStringId(0x1413) and return\n3. Create panel base object from g_PanelBaseDescriptor\n4. Create game name label from g_LobbyDescriptor0, set text (string ID 0x141f)\n5. Create password label from g_LobbyDescriptor1, set text (string ID 0x149a)\n6. Create max players label from g_LobbyDescriptor2, set text (string ID 0x1469)\n7. Create difficulty label from g_LobbyDescriptor3, set text (string ID 0x149b)\n8. Create game list container from g_GameListContainerDescriptor\n9. Create and configure current input control (g_ChildObjectType7)\n10. Create game name edit box (g_GameNameEditDescriptor) with:\n    - Control value 0x10\n    - Field value callback at 0x6fa0ef50\n    - Data field callback at 0x6fa0f000\n11. Create password edit box (g_PasswordEditDescriptor) with:\n    - Control value 0x10\n    - Field callback at 0x6fa10540\n12. Link game name and password edit boxes in double-linked list\n13. Create text control from g_TextControlDescriptor\n14. If Ordinal_10002 (battle.net session check) returns non-zero:\n    - Call Ordinal_10056 to set up session data\n    - Call Ordinal_10059(0x87) for session configuration\n15. Create secondary control from g_SecondaryControlDescriptor\n16. Check if 5000ms elapsed since last refresh (GetTickCount vs g_dwLastRefreshTick)\n17. If refresh needed:\n    a. Update g_dwLastRefreshTick\n    b. Set g_dwInventoryPanelMode = 3\n    c. Reset g_nGameListCount = 0\n    d. If character is in lobby (offset 0x356 == 2):\n       - Clear session buffer (24 bytes)\n       - Check expansion flag (offset 0x1ea & 4), set 0x800 if set\n       - Increment g_wSessionRequestId (skip 0)\n       - Call Ordinal_10006 to request game list\n       - Store request ID in g_wLastSessionRequestId\n    e. Else call FetchAndFilterGameListByDifficulty\n18. Set current input pointer to game name edit box\n19. Reset g_nFilteredGameCount and g_nGameListCount to 0\n20. Get edit box text content via D2Win_GetEditBoxChild\n21. If text exists, convert Unicode to ANSI (max 255 chars)\n22. Count text length to determine if filter should be applied\n23. Call SetUnitBitMask to enable/disable filtering based on text presence\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early return if GetGameListDataPointer returns -1 (no valid game data)\n- Session request ID skips 0 value (wrapped increment)\n- Refresh only triggers if 5000ms+ elapsed since last refresh\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1413: Error string ID for invalid game list\n- 0x141f: Game name label string ID\n- 0x149a: Password label string ID\n- 0x1469: Max players label string ID\n- 0x149b: Difficulty label string ID\n- 0x10: Edit control type value\n- 0x87: Session configuration flag\n- 4999: Refresh threshold (5000ms - 1)\n- 0x356: Offset to lobby state flag in game data\n- 0x1ea: Offset to expansion flags in game data\n- 0x800: Expansion mode bit flag\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10002: Battle.net session validation check\n- Ordinal_10056: Session data initialization\n- Ordinal_10059: Session configuration (parameter 0x87)\n- Ordinal_10006: Request game list from server\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_pPanelBaseObject: Panel base control object\n- g_pGameNameLabel: Game name text label\n- g_pPasswordLabel: Password text label\n- g_pMaxPlayersLabel: Max players text label\n- g_pDifficultyLabel: Difficulty text label\n- g_pGameListContainer: Game list container control\n- g_pCurrentInputControl: Current input focus control\n- g_pGameNameEditBox: Game name edit field\n- g_pPasswordEditBox: Password edit field\n- g_pTextControl: Text display control\n- g_pGameListSecondaryControl: Secondary game list control\n- g_dwLastRefreshTick: Last refresh timestamp\n- g_dwInventoryPanelMode: Panel mode state\n- g_nGameListCount: Number of games in list\n- g_nFilteredGameCount: Number of filtered games\n- g_wSessionRequestId: Current session request ID\n- g_wLastSessionRequestId: Last session request ID sent\n\nNote: Function body is truncated in Ghidra (single instruction in listing).\nDecompiler produces full output but variable renaming limited.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
