      "name": "UpdateMaxPlayersToggleState",
      "signature": "void UpdateMaxPlayersToggleState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Updates the UI state based on the Max Players toggle button.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if Max Players toggle button is in valid/enabled state\n2. If toggle is OFF (invalid):\n   a. Enable difficulty buttons (bit 1 set)\n   b. Disable max players edit boxes (bit 0 clear)\n   c. Disable max players input controls (SetUnitBitMask 0)\n   d. Set text labels with font style 5 (disabled appearance)\n3. If toggle is ON (valid):\n   a. Disable difficulty buttons (bit 0 clear)\n   b. Enable max players edit boxes (bit 1 set)\n   c. Enable max players input controls (SetUnitBitMask 1)\n   d. Set text labels with font style 4 (enabled appearance)\n4. Update second text box with appropriate style for current state\n5. Call ValidateGameCreationFields to update OK button state\n\nParameters:\n  None - Function uses global UI control pointers\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nDecompiler Variables (Phantom - register temporaries):\n  iVar1 - IsButtonValid return value (EAX)\n  wszText/wszText_00/wszText_01 - ValidateStringId return values (EAX)\n  dVar2 - Font style parameter (4=enabled, 5=disabled)\n  bVar3 - Always 0, padding parameter for TextBoxAddText\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x148b - String ID for first max players label text\n  0x148c - String ID for second max players label text\n  4 - Font style for enabled/active state\n  5 - Font style for disabled/inactive state\n\nCalled By:\n  Function at 0x6fa10084 - Game creation dialog handler\n\nCallees:\n  IsButtonValid - Check toggle button state\n  SetOrClearBitMask - Enable/disable UI control visibility\n  SetUnitBitMask - Enable/disable control interactivity\n  ValidateStringId - Get localized string by ID\n  TextBoxAddText - Set text box content with font style\n  ValidateGameCreationFields - Validate inputs and update OK button",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:0decacc108dbbd0391c01c22d8683de941852b3a75a7632aa94d59d9a293f575",
