      "name": "ResetInventoryPanelSlotsAndSetInput",
      "signature": "int ResetInventoryPanelSlotsAndSetInput(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Resets inventory panel slots and sets the default input item.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch inventory item handlers for panel slots 1-4 to clear/reset them\n2. Clear g_dwSpecialModeFlag to 0 (disables special mode processing)\n3. Set current input item to g_apBnetUIObjects[10] (default chat input)\n4. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_dwInventoryPanelSlot1 (0x6fa3e9c8) - Reset via DispatchInventoryItemHandler\n  g_dwInventoryPanelSlot2 (0x6fa3e9bc) - Reset via DispatchInventoryItemHandler\n  g_dwInventoryPanelSlot3 (0x6fa3e9c0) - Reset via DispatchInventoryItemHandler\n  g_dwInventoryPanelSlot4 (0x6fa3e9c4) - Reset via DispatchInventoryItemHandler\n  g_dwSpecialModeFlag (0x6fa3e9cc) - Set to 0\n\nCallers:\n  Called by 30 functions including EnterBattleNetMultiplayerUI,\n  ResetUIStateHandler, InitializePanelMode2, ResetInventoryPanelState,\n  SetInventoryPanelVisibility, InitializeGameJoinSession, and various\n  inventory panel initialization/reset functions.\n\nNotes:\n  - This is a leaf function that only calls external imports\n  - DispatchInventoryItemHandler and SetCurrentInputItem are thunks to D2Win\n  - g_apBnetUIObjects[10] is the main Battle.net chat input field\n  - Called during both UI initialization and cleanup phases",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:a48e09661860488a3f0b6cacd4c1ce8d99f608999700ae04dc8e70f0188b1a12",
