      "comment": "Message Pump Callback for Password Confirmation Dialog\n\nCRITICAL: Function boundaries incorrect in Ghidra. Only PUSH 0x0 visible.\nFull function extends from 0x6fa03f10 to 0x6fa03f37 (RET 4).\n\nClassification: Callback function for MessagePumpLoop\nCalled from: FUN_6fa03f80 (password confirmation flow)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10055 with parameter 0 (D2Multi password validation)\n2. Check GetTickCount return value for timing validation\n3. If tick is 0, call StopMessageLoop and exit\n4. Check g_dwDialogConfirmState flag\n5. If flag is set (non-zero), call StopMessageLoop\n6. Return TRUE to continue message pump\n\nParameters:\n  void - No parameters (callback signature)\n\nReturns:\n  bool - Always returns TRUE (1) to continue message pump processing\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Function body truncated in Ghidra analysis (only PUSH 0x0 visible)\n  - Use hex view at 0x6fa03f10 to see actual code bytes\n  - Manual disassembly required to see full logic\n  - Requires manual function recreation to fix boundaries\n\nOrdinal References:\n  - Ordinal_10055: D2Multi password/dialog validation function\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  - g_dwDialogConfirmState (0x6fa2189c): Dialog confirmation flag\n\nManual Disassembly (from hex dump):\n  0x6fa03f10: PUSH 0             ; Push 0 parameter\n  0x6fa03f12: CALL Ordinal_10055 ; Password validation\n  0x6fa03f17: PUSH EAX           ; Save result\n  0x6fa03f18: CALL GetTickCount  ; Import 0x6fa19284\n  0x6fa03f1e: TEST EAX, EAX      ; Check tick non-zero\n  0x6fa03f20: JZ 0x6fa03f2b      ; If zero, stop\n  0x6fa03f22: MOV EAX, [g_dwDialogConfirmState]\n  0x6fa03f27: TEST EAX, EAX      ; Check flag\n  0x6fa03f29: JZ 0x6fa03f30      ; If zero, continue\n  0x6fa03f2b: CALL StopMessageLoop\n  0x6fa03f30: MOV EAX, 1         ; Return TRUE\n  0x6fa03f35: RET 4              ; stdcall cleanup",
