      "name": "AddOrUpdateChannelEntry",
      "signature": "void AddOrUpdateChannelEntry(char * lpszChannelName, char * lpszDescription)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Adds or updates a channel entry in the Battle.net channel list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Search for existing channel by name (stripping leading '*' prefix)\n2. For each node in g_pChannelListHead linked list:\n   a. Find '*' delimiter in input channel name, use suffix for comparison\n   b. Find '*' delimiter in stored channel name, use suffix for comparison\n   c. Compare strings byte-by-byte (inline strcmp)\n3. If match found: copy description to existing node at offset +0x32, return\n4. If no match and list at capacity (0x400 entries):\n   a. Remove head node from list\n   b. Call ReleasePoolAllocation to free oldest entry\n   c. Decrement g_dwChannelListCount\n5. Allocate new 0x48-byte channel node via FogMemAlloc\n6. Copy channel name string to node offset +0x00 (inline strcpy with DWORD optimization)\n7. Copy description string to node offset +0x32 (inline strcpy with DWORD optimization)\n8. Clear next pointer at offset +0x44 to NULL\n9. If inserting after existing node: set prev->pNext to new node\n10. If inserting at head: set g_pChannelListHead to new node\n11. Increment g_dwChannelListCount\n\nParameters:\n  lpszChannelName (ECX) - Channel name string, may contain '*' prefix delimiter\n  lpszDescription (EDX) - Channel description string to store\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nChannel Node Structure Layout (0x48 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field          Type      Description\n  0x00    50    szChannelName  char[50]  Channel name string\n  0x32    18    szDescription  char[18]  Channel description\n  0x44    4     pNext          void *    Next node in linked list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x2A (42)   - ASCII '*' delimiter character\n  0x48 (72)   - Channel node structure size\n  0x32 (50)   - Offset to description field\n  0x44 (68)   - Offset to next pointer\n  0x400 (1024) - Maximum channel list entries\n  0x8B0 (2224) - Source line number for FogMemAlloc\n\nGlobals:\n  g_pChannelListHead (0x6fa21a94)  - Head of channel linked list\n  g_dwChannelListCount (0x6fa21a98) - Current channel count",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:2ef946229fae8ada7c3d94d1dc27f3f8068d0a656feb2027bab99fc85f801ced",
