      "comment": "Prepends a color code prefix to a Unicode string for colored text display.\n\nClassification: Worker function - string formatting utility for chat display\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize 1024-Unicode temp buffer (awszTempBuffer) via constructor loop (0x200 iterations)\n2. Initialize 8-Unicode color code buffer (aUStack_408) via constructor loop (3 iterations)\n3. Get color prefix string from string table (ID 0xF9A) via ValidateStringId\n4. Copy color prefix to temp buffer via Unicode::strcpy\n5. Convert color code number (nColorCode) to ANSI string via wsprintfA with szFmtNumber format\n6. Convert ANSI color string to Unicode (aUStack_408) via Unicode::toUnicode\n7. Append Unicode color code to temp buffer via Unicode::strcat\n8. If destination string is non-empty:\n   a. Get string length via Unicode::strlen\n   b. If length > 499, assert failure and terminate (prevents buffer overflow)\n   c. Append original string to temp buffer via Unicode::strcat\n9. Copy completed formatted string back to destination via Unicode::strcpy\n\nParameters:\n  pwszDestString (ECX): Unicode * - Destination string buffer, modified in-place with color prefix prepended\n  nColorCode (EDX): int - Color code number to prepend (converted via szFmtNumber format string)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Result written to pwszDestString in-place\n\nCaller: DisplayFormattedChatPlayerName - used for coloring player names in chat\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Empty destination string: Only color prefix is written (original content skipped)\n  - String length > 499: Triggers FogAssert with szAssertUnicodeStrlenLimit, then terminates via FUN_6fa12bdd(-1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xF9A (3994): String table ID for color prefix template\n  0x200 (512): Loop count for 1024-byte buffer initialization (Unicode size = 1)\n  0x3 (3): Loop count for 8-byte color buffer initialization\n  499 (0x1F3): Maximum allowed string length before assertion\n  0xB05 (2821): Line number in ComCallback.cpp for assertion\n\nStack Frame (0x40C bytes):\n  Offset    Size    Variable           Type\n  -0x400    1024    awszTempBuffer     Unicode[1024] - Temp buffer for string assembly\n  -0x408    8       aUStack_408        Unicode[8] - Unicode color code buffer\n  -0x40C    4       aCStack_40c        CHAR[4] - ANSI color code string\n\nDecompiler Notes:\n  - extraout_EAX captures return value from ValidateStringId (color prefix string pointer)\n  - pUVar2/pwszIterator reused for both initialization loops\n  - iVar1/nLoopCounter reused as loop counter and string length",
