      "name": "RenderBnetListVisibleItems",
      "signature": "void RenderBnetListVisibleItems(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Renders visible items in the Battle.net game list UI.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If game list is empty, return immediately\n2. Detach head node from global list, prepare for insertion sort\n3. For each remaining node in unsorted list:\n   a. Calculate priority based on state flags (bit 1=4, bit 3=3, bit 0=2, bit 2=1, else 0)\n   b. Find insertion point in sorted list by comparing priorities\n   c. Insert node at correct position (higher priority first)\n4. Restore sorted list to global head pointer\n5. Initialize Y position to 0x46 (70 pixels), item index to 0\n6. For each item in sorted list:\n   a. If item index outside visible range [scroll_pos, scroll_pos+11):\n      - Build render flags for non-visible item (hidden state)\n   b. If item index within visible range:\n      - Call SetUnitField14 to set Y position on composite unit\n      - Build render flags based on game properties\n      - Apply alternating row highlight on odd indices\n      - Advance Y position by 0x3C (60 pixels per row)\n   c. Write render flags to composite unit via WriteValueToPointer\n   d. Advance to next node\n\nParameters:\n  None (void)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nStructure Layout (Game List Node):\n  Offset  Size  Field        Description\n  0x8a    2     wFlags       Item flags (bit 2=passworded, bit 3=full, bit 5=expansion, bits 8-12=difficulty)\n  0x90    4     dwState      State flags (bit 0=joinable, bit 1=private, bit 3=ladder, bit 5=hardcore)\n  0x9c    4     pUnit        Pointer to CompositeUnit for UI rendering\n  0xa0    4     pNext        Next node pointer in linked list\n\nFlag Bits (wFlags at +0x8a):\n  0x04 - Game is password protected\n  0x08 - Game is full\n  0x20 - Expansion game\n  0x1F00 - Difficulty level (5 bits, shifted >> 8)\n\nState Flags (dwState at +0x90):\n  0x01 - Joinable game\n  0x02 - Private game\n  0x08 - Ladder game\n  0x09 - Combined joinable/ladder check\n  0x20 - Hardcore mode\n\nBitmask Offsets (gdwBitMasks/gdwInvBitMasks):\n  +0x10 - Full game indicator\n  +0x14 - Password protected indicator\n  +0x18 - Difficulty tier low bit\n  +0x1C - Difficulty tier high bit\n  +0x20 - Alternating row highlight\n  +0x24 - Hardcore mode indicator\n  +0x28 - Selected item indicator\n  +0x2C - Joinable/ladder combined\n  +0x30 - Expansion mode indicator\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x46 (70) - Initial Y position for first visible item\n  0x3C (60) - Vertical spacing between list items\n  0x0B (11) - Maximum visible items in list window\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  g_pGameListHead (0x6fa21a90) - Head of game list linked list\n  g_dwAutomapScrollPosition (0x6fa21aa0) - Current scroll position\n  g_pChatHistoryBuffer (0x6fa21aa4) - Selected game node pointer\n  gdwBitMasks_exref - External bitmask array for setting flags\n  gdwInvBitMasks_exref - External inverse bitmask array for clearing flags",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
