      "name": "ProcessChatInputCommand",
      "signature": "int ProcessChatInputCommand(wchar_t * wszInput)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "ProcessChatInputCommand - Processes chat input text and handles slash commands\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset autocomplete selection index to -1 (invalid)\n2. Get input string length via Unicode::strlen; return 0 if empty\n3. Validate callback vtable exists; assert and exit if null\n4. Convert Unicode input to Windows ANSI codepage (max 256 chars)\n5. Copy ANSI string to temp buffer for tokenization\n6. Check for URL parameter suffix delimiter; clear input and return 1 if found\n7. Copy ANSI string to global command buffer (g_szCommandBuffer)\n8. If command starts with '/':\n   a. Shift autocomplete history array down by one slot (256 bytes each)\n   b. Copy current command to first autocomplete entry\n   c. Increment entry count (capped at 10)\n   d. Try HandleReplyWhisperCommand with \"/reply\" and \"/r\" patterns\n   e. Check for \"/d2notify\" command using StringPrefixMatchCaseInsensitive\n   f. If d2notify: toggle g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled flag, display status\n   g. For unknown commands: invoke vtable callback or show error panel\n9. If command does NOT start with '/':\n   a. Check vtable callback availability via offset 0x74\n   b. If unavailable: cleanup sub-children, create UI elements for text input\n   c. If available: invoke callback and display formatted chat player name\n10. Clear current input field via EditData_SetString(NULL)\n11. Calculate text box line count, scroll to bottom if content overflows\n12. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  lpwszInput (wchar_t*) - Unicode string containing chat input text from edit box\n  IMPLICIT: EDI contains char* szInputString for Unicode::strlen\n\nReturns:\n  0 - Input string was empty (no processing performed)\n  1 - Input processed successfully\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_dwAutocompleteCurrentIndex (0x6fa1b04c) - Current autocomplete selection (-1 = none)\n  g_pCallbackVtable (0x6fa20a1c) - Callback interface vtable for command dispatch\n  g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0) - Current EditData pointer for input field\n  g_szCommandBuffer (0x6fa214a8) - Global ANSI command buffer (256 bytes)\n  g_aszAutocompleteEntries (0x6fa20aa4) - Autocomplete history array (10x256 bytes)\n  g_aszAutocompleteEntriesBackup (0x6fa20ba4) - Backup slot for autocomplete shift\n  g_dwAutocompleteEntryCount (0x6fa2188c) - Number of valid autocomplete entries\n  g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled (0x6fa21890) - Player join/leave notification toggle\n  g_nNumSubChildren (0x6fa21734) - UI sub-children count for inventory panel\n  g_apSubChildrenArray (0x6fa20a20) - UI sub-children pointer array\n  g_pCharSelectControl (0x6fa218c8) - Character select text box control\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Empty input returns 0 immediately without vtable validation\n  - Null callback vtable triggers FogAssert with line 0xf48 (3912)\n  - URL parameter suffix (szUrlParamSuffix) clears field without command processing\n  - /d2notify toggles player enter/leave channel notifications\n  - Autocomplete history is FIFO with 10 entry maximum\n  - Max sub-children is 32 (0x20), asserts at line 0x1086 (4230) if exceeded\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xffffffff - Invalid autocomplete index\n  0x100 (256) - Max ANSI string buffer size\n  0x200 (512) - Unicode status message buffer size\n  0x900 (2304) - Autocomplete backup size (9 entries x 256 bytes)\n  0x14e7 (5351) - String ID for error message\n  0x21 (33) - UI descriptor index for text box creation\n  0x74 - Vtable offset for command availability check\n  0x14 - Vtable offset for command execution callback",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
