      "name": "HandleGameSlotButtonClick",
      "signature": "dword HandleGameSlotButtonClick(dword * pEventData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Handles mouse click events on game slot buttons in the multiplayer profile selection UI.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Search through g_aSlotPointers[0..10] array to find which slot was clicked\n2. If no matching slot found, return 0 (unhandled)\n3. Calculate slot index as g_nSlotIndexBase + matched_index\n4. For WM_LBUTTONUP (0x205):\n   a. Find the UI node at the slot index by traversing linked list\n   b. Get profile name from edit box child at offset +0x04\n   c. Compare with stored profile name at g_pCurrentProfile+0x88\n   d. If names match: Call InitializeProfileEditPanel with existing profile flags\n   e. If names differ: Call InitializeProfileCreationPanel for new profile\n5. For other events: Update UI element visibility based on profile state\n   - Get current tick count for timing\n   - Clear previous selection if needed\n   - Update visibility of OK/Cancel/Delete/Edit buttons based on profile validity\n\nParameters:\npEventData - Pointer to event structure containing:\n  [0x00] dwEventId - UI control identifier that was clicked\n  [0x04] dwMessage - Windows message type (e.g., 0x205 = WM_LBUTTONUP)\n\nReturns:\n1 - Event was handled successfully\n0 - Event not handled (slot not found in array)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x205 = WM_LBUTTONUP - Left mouse button released\n0x6fa216fc = g_aSlotPointers - Array of slot pointer IDs\n0x6fa21728 = End of slot pointer array (11 entries)\n0x6fa21a90 = g_pFirstSlotNode - First node in slot linked list\n0x6fa21aa0 = g_nSlotIndexBase - Base offset for slot indexing\n0x6fa21aa4 = g_pSelectedProfile - Currently selected profile pointer\n0x6fa1d798 = g_nSelectedSlotIndex - Index of selected slot (-1 if none)\n0xA0 = Offset to next node pointer in slot node structure\n0x9C = Offset to profile button pointer in slot node",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:751a24bb90e273c3819793e0415a17c2",
