      "name": "ProcessBnetPlayerJoinNotification",
      "signature": "int ProcessBnetPlayerJoinNotification(void * this, byte * pbGameData, uint * pdwOptions)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Processes a Battle.net player join event and displays a notification in the chat channel.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call AddOrUpdateBnetGameEntry to register/update the player in the game list\n2. Check if player notifications are enabled (g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled)\n3. If disabled, skip notification and return success\n4. Calculate player name string length using SCASB.REPNE at offset +0x36 in entry\n5. Format join message using szFmtPlayerJoinedChannel (\"%s has joined the channel.\")\n6. Initialize Unicode buffer (576 wchar_t elements) with default constructor\n7. Convert ANSI message to Unicode using win2Unicode\n8. Validate Unicode string length is under 500 characters (assert if exceeded)\n9. Get filter string from string ID 0xF9A using ValidateStringId\n10. Find and remove all occurrences of filter string from message\n11. Display filtered message in chat text box with color code 5\n\nParameters:\n  this (ECX, IMPLICIT): Game ID passed to AddOrUpdateBnetGameEntry as dwGameId\n  pbGameData: Pointer to player data structure containing name at offset +0x36\n  pdwOptions: Options passed to AddOrUpdateBnetGameEntry\n\nReturns:\n  int: Always returns 1 (success)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If notifications disabled, returns immediately after updating game entry\n  - If Unicode string exceeds 499 characters, triggers FogAssert and calls FUN_6fa12bdd(-1)\n  - Filter string removal loop continues until no matches or end of filtered match\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x36 - Offset to player name within game entry structure\n  0x240 - Unicode buffer size (576 elements)\n  0x1F4 - Max string length validation (500)\n  0xF9A - String ID for filter pattern\n  5 - Chat text color code for join messages",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:4d60f2cb06782a10d450d27e9a5c31f9",
