      "name": "FormatIncomingWhisperWithTitle",
      "signature": "int FormatIncomingWhisperWithTitle(char * lpszRawWhisperMessage)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Formats an incoming whisper message with optional player title for display.\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - Called from whisper message handling table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Parse raw whisper message to extract player name and title using ParseChatPlayerNameAndTitle\n2. Check if extracted title is empty by measuring string length\n3. If title is empty:\n   a. Look for '*' character delimiter in raw message\n   b. Format output using \"You whisper to %s: %s\" template with message after delimiter\n4. If title exists:\n   a. Check if player name is also non-empty\n   b. If name exists, copy title directly to formatted name buffer\n   c. Otherwise format as \"%s (%s)\" combining name and title\n   d. Format final message using \"You whisper to %s: %s\" template\n5. Initialize Unicode buffer with 576 wide characters (0x240)\n6. Convert formatted ANSI string to Unicode using win2Unicode\n7. Validate Unicode string length does not exceed 499 characters (0x1F3)\n8. If exceeded, trigger FogAssert with line 0x2E4 and exit\n9. Retrieve localized placeholder string ID 0xF9A using ValidateStringId\n10. Loop: Find and remove placeholder substrings from Unicode buffer\n11. Add formatted Unicode text to chat display with color 2 (whisper color)\n\nParameters:\n  lpszRawWhisperMessage (char *): Raw incoming whisper containing player info and message\n  lpszWhisperText (char *): The actual whisper message text content\n\nReturns:\n  int: Always returns 1 (success)\n\nStack Layout (0x974 bytes total):\n  Offset     Size   Variable                Description\n  -0x974     256    szExtractedTitle        Parsed player title\n  -0x874     256    szFormattedName         Name formatted with title\n  -0x774     256    szExtractedPlayerName   Parsed player name\n  -0x674     1152   awszUnicodeBuffer       Unicode output (576 wchar_t)\n  -0x1F4     500    szFormattedMessage      Final ANSI message\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x2A (42)   - ASCII '*' character delimiter\n  0x240 (576) - Unicode buffer size in wide characters\n  0x1F4 (500) - Maximum ANSI message length\n  0x1F3 (499) - Maximum Unicode string length before assert\n  0x2E4 (740) - Assert line number in ComCallback.cpp\n  0xF9A (3994)- Localized placeholder string ID\n  2           - Whisper text display color",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.08",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:38cfedc0c99e7de76a5dcb7824903353",
