      "name": "InitializeEntityStateFlags",
      "signature": "int InitializeEntityStateFlags(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize entity state bit flags for the current game context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global entity pointer from address 0x6fa09f88\n2. Call ModifyEntityStateBitFlags to update entity state flags\n3. Return success indicator (1)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nint - Always returns 1 to indicate successful completion\n\nSpecial Cases:\nGlobal entity pointer at 0x6fa09f88 must be initialized before calling this function. This wrapper always succeeds with no error handling. Typically called during game state initialization or entity activation.",
