      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize entity validation and reset global state\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global handler structure from DAT_6fa0917c\n2. Call virtual function handler at offset +0x1c with callback parameter 0\n3. Execute entity setup routine (FUN_6f9dbe00)\n4. Load entity pointer from DAT_6fa09154 and validate it with EDX=0\n5. Load entity pointer from DAT_6fa09150 and validate it with EDX=0\n6. Load entity pointer from DAT_6fa09158 and validate it with EDX=0\n7. Load entity pointer from DAT_6fa0915c and validate it with EDX=0\n8. Reset validation flag at DAT_6fa09f20 to 0\n9. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nNone (void function)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic numbers:\n- 0x1c: Offset in handler structure for virtual function pointer\n- 0x0: Parameter passed to virtual function handler\n- Global addresses store entity pointers requiring validation\n\nCalled By:\n- InitializeGameEngine @ 0x6f9dd9d0\n- ProcessEntityModeAndNotify @ 0x6f9dd000",
