      "name": "ValidateAndInitializeRenderingState",
      "signature": "int ValidateAndInitializeRenderingState(int stateParam)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates rendering state and conditionally initializes rendering system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global rendering state object from fixed address (0x6fa0917c)\n2. Call virtual method at offset +0x8c with state parameter\n3. Test return value from virtual method call\n4. If return value non-zero, invoke InitializeRenderingState()\n5. Return success code (1)\n\nParameters:\n  stateParam (int) - State identifier passed to virtual method\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success/completion indicator)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 1 regardless of initialization outcome\n  - Initialization only called if virtual method returns non-zero\n  - Global rendering state object address is hardcoded\n\nStructure Layout:\n  The global object at 0x6fa0917c is a virtual object with method table.\n  Offset 0x8c in the method table points to a validation/query function.",
