      "name": "ConvertFieldValueToInteger",
      "signature": "int ConvertFieldValueToInteger(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Converts a validated object field to an integer value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load context pointer from global state (0x6fa09d38)\n2. Call ValidateAndGetObjectField() to retrieve Unicode string pointer\n3. Convert Unicode string to UTF-8 using Unicode::toUtf() with 5-byte limit\n4. Convert resulting UTF-8 string to integer using _atol()\n5. Return converted value in EAX\n\nParameters:\nNone (implicitly uses global context)\n\nReturns:\nint - Integer value converted from field, or 0 if conversion fails\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- UTF-8 buffer limited to 5 bytes on stack\n- Non-numeric UTF-8 sequences convert to 0 via _atol()\n- Field validation may fail with error code",
