      "name": "InitializeGameUIWithValidation",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameUIWithValidation(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes game UI elements and command dispatch based on structure validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate game structure type via ValidateStructureType()\n2. If validation succeeds (result = 0):\n   - Modify 4 entity state bitflags with alternating patterns (0, 0, 1, 1)\n   - Modify 3 object bitfields with pattern (1, 1, 1)\n   - Dispatch command 0x4 with parameters (0, 0)\n   - Render text box with command 0x4\n3. If validation fails (result != 0):\n   - Modify 4 entity state bitflags with alternating patterns (1, 1, 0, 0)\n   - Modify 3 object bitfields with pattern (0, 0, 0)\n   - Dispatch command 0x5 with parameters (0, 0)\n   - Render text box with command 0x5\n4. Common path: Dispatch final command with merged parameters\n5. Render final text box with merged command\n6. Validate and process resting area peers\n7. Return 1 (success)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x148b and 0x148c used as command identifiers\n- Global pointers at offsets 0x6fa09d** reference entity/object instances\n- Command dispatch uses __stdcall with 3 parameters (commandId, param1, param2)\n- All parameters initialized to 0 except commandId",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:e498f4a39acd95f533de8d6724f9006f",
